WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.868
-We're joined right now
by the one and only John Cena,

00:00:02.868 --> 00:00:04.203
everybody.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:04.203 --> 00:00:09.875
♪♪

00:00:09.875 --> 00:00:11.777
-That's the good news.

00:00:11.777 --> 00:00:14.046
-The bad news is John and I
are about to face off

00:00:14.046 --> 00:00:17.383
in a brand-new game
called "Fish Slap." Now --

00:00:17.383 --> 00:00:18.551
[ Laughter ]
-Whoo!

00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:21.053
-It works like the game
"High or Low."

00:00:21.053 --> 00:00:23.189
We'll take turns being dealer.

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:25.157
You deal one card, then
the other person guesses

00:00:25.157 --> 00:00:28.194
whether the next one
will be higher or lower.

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:29.562
Aces are high.

00:00:29.562 --> 00:00:31.998
If you guess wrong,
you get fish slapped. And, uh --

00:00:31.998 --> 00:00:34.501
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:37.604
The dealer gets to slap you with
a fish from their fish bucket.

00:00:37.604 --> 00:00:39.171
[ Laughter ]
This is a real --

00:00:39.171 --> 00:00:40.906
These are real --
-It really is.

00:00:40.906 --> 00:00:42.909
-Yeah, they -- I can smell them.
-Yeah.

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:45.344
-They will be eaten by the crew
after the show.

00:00:45.344 --> 00:00:47.213
[ Laughter ]
They won't be wasted.

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:50.116
Now, if you get
the exact same card,

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:52.251
we both slap each other
at the same time.

00:00:52.251 --> 00:00:54.954
-In the event of a draw --
-Oh, my God. Double fish slap.

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:56.589
-Okay.
-The Internet is gonna break.

00:00:56.589 --> 00:00:58.024
[ Laughter ]
-[ Sighs ]

00:00:58.024 --> 00:01:00.593
-All right, first to fish slap
the other person three times

00:01:00.593 --> 00:01:01.394
is the champion.

00:01:01.394 --> 00:01:03.596
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.596 --> 00:01:05.165
[ Coughing ]

00:01:05.165 --> 00:01:06.765
-Welp, yep. That's everything.
-Here we go.

00:01:06.765 --> 00:01:08.367
-All right.
-We've actually done everything.

00:01:08.367 --> 00:01:10.303
All right, so I go --
I'll deal first --

00:01:10.303 --> 00:01:11.337
-Yes.
-To you.

00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:12.872
-Yeah.
-All right, here we go.

00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:14.507
Do you trust these cards?
Do you want me to shuffle?

00:01:14.507 --> 00:01:16.576
-No, I don't --
No, not at all.

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:19.612
We're gonna try it, though.

00:01:19.612 --> 00:01:21.580
-Ooh.
-Oh, come on.

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:24.317
-Higher or lower,
that's pretty easy.

00:01:24.317 --> 00:01:26.152
-Pretty easy?
It's right in the middle.

00:01:26.152 --> 00:01:27.486
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.486 --> 00:01:30.156
Fallon, you son of a bitch.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.156 --> 00:01:32.191
-I didn't even hit you
with a fish yet!

00:01:32.191 --> 00:01:34.326
What do you think?
Higher or lower? It's seven.

00:01:34.326 --> 00:01:36.463
-Low.
-You're gonna go lower.

00:01:36.463 --> 00:01:40.766
-Low.

00:01:40.766 --> 00:01:42.869
-Oh! You lucky -- You lucky --

00:01:42.869 --> 00:01:44.470
[ Sad tuba plays ]

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:46.439
Oh, my gosh.

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:49.075
[ Drum roll ]
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:49.075 --> 00:01:52.077
All right, y-you won that one.

00:01:52.077 --> 00:01:55.114
-All right, Fallon.
-[ Inhales deeply ]

00:01:55.114 --> 00:01:58.250
Oh!
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.250 --> 00:02:00.152
-"Oh, I don't know. Is it
going to be higher or lower?

00:02:00.152 --> 00:02:01.420
I don't know, man."

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:03.923
-I hate your whole face.

00:02:03.923 --> 00:02:07.160
-Now does this mean I slap you
if I win?

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:09.562
-No, because I just won,
and no slaps happened.

00:02:09.562 --> 00:02:11.831
I think it's if you lose.
If you lose.

00:02:11.831 --> 00:02:12.765
-Okay.
-All right.

00:02:12.765 --> 00:02:13.799
I would slap you --
-Lower.

00:02:13.799 --> 00:02:14.867
That's lower.
-You're going to go low?

00:02:14.867 --> 00:02:16.869
-Definitely.
-Okay, great.

00:02:16.869 --> 00:02:20.039
-That's actually really low.
All right, wow, here we go.

00:02:20.039 --> 00:02:21.107
Ready?

00:02:21.107 --> 00:02:25.745
-High.

00:02:25.745 --> 00:02:28.414
Good.

00:02:28.414 --> 00:02:30.082
-I want to see some
fish slapping here.

00:02:30.082 --> 00:02:32.818
Oh.
Go low, low, right?

00:02:32.818 --> 00:02:34.187
-Oh!
-What?!

00:02:34.187 --> 00:02:36.155
[ Audience ohs ]

00:02:36.155 --> 00:02:37.657
[ Sad tuba plays ]

00:02:37.657 --> 00:02:41.093
come on, that's higher
than a queen!

00:02:41.093 --> 00:02:45.097
All right, be gentle, dude.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.097 --> 00:02:48.868
[ Audience cheering ]

00:02:48.868 --> 00:02:50.937
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:50.937 --> 00:02:54.340
♪♪

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:56.642
-I just wanted
to get a feel for it.

00:02:56.642 --> 00:02:59.045
-That slap was a real --
Can we have in it slow motion?

00:02:59.045 --> 00:03:01.780
That slap was a bit backhanded
a little.

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:04.884
[ Laughter ]
All right, here we go.

00:03:04.884 --> 00:03:06.652
There was a good little slap
to it.

00:03:06.652 --> 00:03:09.322
And I smell like fish right now.
Here we go.

00:03:09.322 --> 00:03:10.823
This is for you, right?

00:03:10.823 --> 00:03:15.227
-High.
-You think?

00:03:15.227 --> 00:03:16.862
[ Laughs ]

00:03:16.862 --> 00:03:18.932
[ Audience oohs ]

00:03:18.932 --> 00:03:23.836
-I will allow you the first --
-No, I've not done mine yet.

00:03:23.836 --> 00:03:24.870
-Go for it.
-Are you sure?

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:26.405
-Go for it.
-No, because then what if

00:03:26.405 --> 00:03:28.007
I do it too hard, then you're
gonna want to retaliate?

00:03:28.007 --> 00:03:29.942
[ Laughter ]

00:03:29.942 --> 00:03:31.643
-Your fate lies
in your own hands.

00:03:31.643 --> 00:03:37.116
-Damn you, Fallon!
[ Laughter ]

00:03:37.116 --> 00:03:40.085
-You can get this side, too.
-No, I wouldn't.

00:03:40.085 --> 00:03:42.154
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:42.154 --> 00:03:45.158
♪♪

00:03:45.158 --> 00:03:47.793
-All right, all right.
You're down to one fish.

00:03:47.793 --> 00:03:49.695
I got two fish left.
This is --

00:03:49.695 --> 00:03:51.597
If you're tuning in or went
for a bathroom break,

00:03:51.597 --> 00:03:53.299
we're still playing "Fish Slap."
-Yeah.

00:03:53.299 --> 00:03:55.201
[ Laughter ]

00:03:55.201 --> 00:03:57.370
You would think this would be
easy. 10.

00:03:57.370 --> 00:03:59.372
So I'm going to go low.

00:03:59.372 --> 00:04:00.940
♪♪

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:04.010
-Okay.
-All right, go ahead.

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:09.148
-High.

00:04:09.148 --> 00:04:11.951
-Gosh.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:11.951 --> 00:04:15.254
♪♪

00:04:15.254 --> 00:04:16.856
-Low!

00:04:16.856 --> 00:04:18.657
-Aah!
-Aah! No!

00:04:18.657 --> 00:04:21.460
[ Sad tuba plays ]
You've got to be kidding me.

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:24.063
-In the name of salmon
and mackerel, the day is mine.

00:04:24.063 --> 00:04:27.166
[ Laughter ]

00:04:27.166 --> 00:04:29.769
[ Cheers and applause ]
I got to get myself --

00:04:29.769 --> 00:04:33.072
♪♪

00:04:33.072 --> 00:04:36.375
♪♪

00:04:36.375 --> 00:04:37.643
-It was like hitting me --
it was like hitting me

00:04:37.643 --> 00:04:40.279
with your -- with your arm!

00:04:40.279 --> 00:04:43.015
Can we see that?
I feel like --

00:04:43.015 --> 00:04:44.550
Slow motion.
This is for real.

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:45.451
Watch this.

00:04:45.451 --> 00:04:47.153
Oh, my God!

00:04:47.153 --> 00:04:50.856
See my jowls --
my jowls started shaking.

00:04:50.856 --> 00:04:52.124
[ Laughter ]
-Dude,

00:04:52.124 --> 00:04:53.592
you came up with this game.
-That's true, I did.

00:04:53.592 --> 00:04:56.695
John Cena, the champ in the
first ever game of "Fish Slap."

00:04:56.695 --> 00:04:57.930
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Truly a sportsman.

